#: ../../quick-reference.rst:176
msgid ""
"*Upstream (proxy)*: ``X-Forwarded-For`` (socket peer, after the received "
"chain when trusted), ``X-Forwarded-Proto``, ``X-Real-IP`` (the judged "
"client), ``X-Sibuna-Status: PASS``, ``X-Sibuna-Rule: <rule>``; hop-by-hop "
"and alternative forwarding fields dropped, underscore spellings too."
msgstr ""

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:177
msgid ""
"*Forward-auth reply*: ``X-Sibuna-Status``, ``X-Sibuna-Rule``, "
"``X-Sibuna-Rule-Hash``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:178
msgid "*Challenge reply*: ``X-Sibuna-Status: CHALLENGE``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:179
msgid ""
"*Cookie*: ``__sibuna_token=<75 chars, 139 with ed25519>; Path=/; "
"Max-Age=<ttl>; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax[; Secure]``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:181
msgid "Policy File Skeleton"
msgstr ""

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:197
msgid ""
"Patterns: ``*`` or ``.*`` any; ``^...$`` exact; trailing ``*`` prefix; "
"leading ``/`` exact path; else case-insensitive substring. Paths are "
"matched in normal form. Order: WAF -> trie deny/allow -> rules -> score "
"-> bypass -> trie challenge -> bots -> default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:199
msgid "Storage (Edge) in SQL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:214
msgid ""
"SQLite (``sqlite3 <dir>/sibuna.db``); actions are lowercase. Score "
":math:`\\le -50` -> deny prefix; :math:`\\ge 50` -> allow. Cluster: same "
"secret on every node, one PostgreSQL database, ``--features postgres``, "
"``--database-url-file <file> --cluster-node N`` with a unique N from 1 to "
"8,388,607; no member list, leader or cluster TLS (SID 0011)."
msgstr ""

